<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Seven Spirits, earnest I beseech Thee!</l><l>O burning fire, set all my heart ablaze!</l><l>Search all my being, from my self deliv’ring;</l><l>O Morning Star, direct through all my days.</l><l>Search all my being, from my self deliv’ring;</l><l>O Morning Star, direct through all my days.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Affix mine eyes, that I behold Thee only;</l><l>Strengthen my spirit, with me ever stay;</l><l>Lord, set my steps to walk Thy path, unswerving;</l><l>Hold fast my hands, unceasingly to pray.</l><l>Lord, set my steps to walk Thy path, unswerving;</l><l>Hold fast my hands, unceasingly to pray.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
